A float is read as the shortest decimal that gives it back:
0.9054054     4527027/5000000
0.518518      259259/500000
0.75          3/4

With its repeating digits in parentheses, a decimal names its fraction:
0.9(054)      67/74
0.(518)       14/27
0.(3)         1/3
1.2(34)       611/495
-0.(142857)   -1/7
0.75          3/4
